  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 19th level, any time the ungermaw uses his draw breath ability or hits a creature with his bite attack, he can spend a use of draw breath to cast either dispel magic or greater dispel magic as a free action. If he uses this in response to hitting a creature with his bite attack, he can only target the creature he struck.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ungermaw#toc39\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
